questions.question:
a) Reduce the blocks and find transfer function for the following model. [8]

b) The open loop transfer function of a unity feedback system is given by;
$G(S)H(S) = \frac{K}{S(1+ST)}$. Where, K is gain constant and T is time constants. With the gain multiplied by a factor K1 the maximum overshoot of the system is increased from 25% to 50%. Determine K1.

